   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. SoV word basis, dual basis Y = W⁻¹ (charge blocks), ket word basis, Gram matrix and measure M = Gram⁻¹ [exact]\n\nRows of `wsW` = ⟨x| in the product basis (`wsComps` order, site 1 most significant), `wsLabels` = (a₁,k₂,a₃,k₄). Columns of `wsYk` = ket words |y⟩ = t₁(θ₁)^{m₁} t_{n₂}(θ₂+n₂h) t₁(θ₃)^{m₃} t_{n₄}(θ₄+n₄h)|0̄⟩. Completeness: ⟨B|Ψ⟩ = Σ_{x,y} ⟨B|y⟩ M_{yx} ⟨x|Ψ⟩ with Gram·M = 1 (M rows = y, columns = x).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsVac = wsProd4[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4]];\nwsLabels = Tuples[Range[0, 3], 4]; wsComps = Tuples[Range[4], 4];\nwsIdx[w_] := FromDigits[w, 4] + 1;\nwsA1 = Table[If[a == 0, wsVac, wsVac . wsT[wsGcz, a, wsTh[[1]] - wsH]], {a, 0, 3}];\nwsT2 = wsT[wsGcz, 1, wsTh[[2]]]; wsT3 = Table[wsT[wsGcz, a, wsTh[[3]] - wsH], {a, 0, 3}]; wsT4 = wsT[wsGcz, 1, wsTh[[4]]];\nwsWordRow[{a1_, k2_, a3_, k4_}] := Module[{v = wsA1[[a1 + 1]]}, Do[v = v . wsT2, {k2}]; v = v . wsT3[[a3 + 1]]; Do[v = v . wsT4, {k4}]; v];\nwsW = SparseArray[wsWordRow /@ wsLabels];\nwsNZ[m_] := Count[Flatten[Normal[m]], Except[0]];\nwsCharge[c_] := (c[[1]] - 1) + (4 - c[[2]]) + (c[[3]] - 1) + (4 - c[[4]]);\nwsBlk = Table[{Flatten[Position[Total /@ wsLabels, d]], Flatten[Position[wsCharge /@ wsComps, d]]}, {d, 0, 12}];\nwsGradOK = AllTrue[wsW[\"NonzeroPositions\"], Total[wsLabels[[#[[1]]]]] == wsCharge[wsComps[[#[[2]]]]] &];\nwsYn = ConstantArray[0, {256, 256}];\nDo[wsYn[[b[[2]], b[[1]]]] = Inverse[Normal[wsW[[b[[1]], b[[2]]]]]], {b, wsBlk}];\nwsY = SparseArray[wsYn]; Clear[wsYn];\nwsKetVac = wsProd4[UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1]];\nwsKet[G_][lab_] := Module[{v = wsKetVac}, Do[If[wsTypes[[s]] == \"A\", Do[v = wsT[G, 1, wsTh[[s]]] . v, {lab[[s]]}], If[lab[[s]] > 0, v = wsT[G, lab[[s]], wsTh[[s]] + lab[[s]] wsH] . v]], {s, 4, 1, -1}]; v];\nwsYk = SparseArray[Transpose[wsKet[wsGcz] /@ wsLabels]];\nwsGram = SparseArray[Normal[wsW . wsYk]];\nwsBar[j_] := wsIdx[3 - wsLabels[[j]]];\nwsMn = ConstantArray[0, {256, 256}];\nDo[Module[{xs = Flatten[Position[Total /@ wsLabels, S]], ys}, ys = wsBar /@ xs; wsMn[[ys, xs]] = Inverse[Normal[wsGram[[xs, ys]]]]], {S, 0, 12}];\nwsM = SparseArray[wsMn]; Clear[wsMn];\nGrid[{{\"grading of the word matrix: W_{x,c} ≠ 0 only if |x| = charge(c)\", wsGradOK},\n  {\"nonzeros of W, of Y = W⁻¹\", {wsNZ[wsW], wsNZ[wsY]}},\n  {\"W.Y == 1 (exact)\", wsW . wsY == IdentityMatrix[256, SparseArray]},\n  {\"rank of the 256 ket words (exact)\", MatrixRank[Normal[wsYk]]},\n  {\"# nonzero ⟨x|y⟩\", wsNZ[wsGram]},\n  {\"charge rule ⟨x|y⟩ ≠ 0 ⇒ |x| + |y| = 12\", AllTrue[wsGram[\"NonzeroPositions\"], Total[wsLabels[[#[[1]]]]] + Total[wsLabels[[#[[2]]]]] == 12 &]},\n  {\"Gram . M == 1 (exact; M_{yx} = (Gram⁻¹)_{yx})\", wsGram . wsM == IdentityMatrix[256, SparseArray]},\n  {\"# nonzero entries of M\", wsNZ[wsM]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"27\" data-out-n=\"60\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"29\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[60]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">grading of the word matrix: W_{x,c} </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> 0 only if |x| = charge(c)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nonzeros of W, of Y = W⁻¹</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">W.Y == 1 (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of the 256 ket words (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># nonzero ⟨x|y⟩</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">charge rule ⟨x|y⟩ </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> 0 </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> |x| + |y| = 12</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gram . M == 1 (exact; M_{yx} = (Gram⁻¹)_{yx})</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># nonzero entries of M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2929</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2929</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1456</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1456</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[60]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{grading of the word matrix: W\\_\\{x,c\\} $\\not=$ 0 only if |x| = charge(c)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{nonzeros of W, of Y = W⁻¹} & \\left\\{2929,2929\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{W.Y == 1 (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank of the 256 ket words (exact)} & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nonzero ⟨x|y⟩} & 1456\\\\\\hline\\text{charge rule ⟨x|y⟩ $\\not=$ 0 $\\Rightarrow$ |x| + |y| = 12} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{Gram . M == 1 (exact; M\\_\\{yx\\} = (Gram⁻¹)\\_\\{yx\\})} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nonzero entries of M} & 1456\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "634c2e24-5b36-4be0-85a0-1acac35539df"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Joint eigenstates (diagonal frame, weight blocks, 60 digits) and their τ-values at the bra and ket word points [hp]\n\n|Ψ_c⟩ = R|Ψ_Λ⟩. τ_x(Ψ) = τ_{a₁}(θ₁−h)τ₁(θ₂)^{k₂}τ_{a₃}(θ₃−h)τ₁(θ₄)^{k₄} (bra word points), τ̃_y(Ψ) = τ₁(θ₁)^{m₁}τ_{n₂}(θ₂+n₂h)τ₁(θ₃)^{m₃}τ_{n₄}(θ₄+n₄h) (ket word points), all from the eigenvalue equations of the companion operators. Since W·Ψ_c = τ_x(Ψ)⟨0|Ψ⟩ with W invertible and the 256 eigenvectors independent, the 256 τ-monomials are linearly independent functions on the 256 eigenstates: any identity among them that holds on all states is trivial, so the exact rank tests of §6 are decisive.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsWeight[idx_] := Table[Count[idx[[{1, 3}]], i] - Count[idx[[{2, 4}]], i], {i, 4}];\nwsBlocks = Values[GroupBy[Range[256], wsWeight[wsComps[[#]]] &]];\nwsComb = wsTbar[wsLam, 1, 3/11] + 7/10 wsTbar[wsLam, 3, -5/7] - 3/13 wsTbar[wsLam, 2, 2/9];\nwsStates = Flatten[Table[Module[{vecs, evs}, {evs, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[Normal[wsComb[[blk, blk]]], 60]]; Table[Module[{v = vecs[[k]], p}, p = Ordering[Abs[v], -1][[1]]; v = v/v[[p]]; <|\"blk\" -> blk, \"weight\" -> wsWeight[wsComps[[blk[[1]]]]], \"vec\" -> v, \"comb\" -> evs[[k]]|>], {k, Length[blk]}]], {blk, wsBlocks}], 1];\nwsPsiD = Transpose[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[#[\"blk\"] -> #[\"vec\"]], 256]] & /@ wsStates];\nwsPsiC = wsR . wsPsiD;\nwsWeights = wsStates[[All, \"weight\"]];\nwsPiv = Table[Ordering[Abs[wsPsiC[[All, n]]], -1][[1]], {n, 256}];\nwsEv[op_, n_] := (op . wsPsiC[[All, n]])[[wsPiv[[n]]]]/wsPsiC[[wsPiv[[n]], n]];\nwsRes[op_, n_] := Norm[op . wsPsiC[[All, n]] - wsEv[op, n] wsPsiC[[All, n]]]/Norm[op . wsPsiC[[All, n]]];\nwsTauA1 = Table[If[a == 0, 1, wsEv[wsT[wsGcz, a, wsTh[[1]] - wsH], n]], {n, 256}, {a, 0, 3}];\nwsTauA3 = Table[If[a == 0, 1, wsEv[wsT3[[a + 1]], n]], {n, 256}, {a, 0, 3}];\nwsR2 = Table[wsEv[wsT2, n], {n, 256}]; wsR4 = Table[wsEv[wsT4, n], {n, 256}];\nwsTauX = Table[wsTauA1[[n, x[[1]] + 1]] wsR2[[n]]^x[[2]] wsTauA3[[n, x[[3]] + 1]] wsR4[[n]]^x[[4]], {x, wsLabels}, {n, 256}];\nwsOv0 = wsVac . wsPsiC;\nwsWPsi = wsW . wsPsiC;\nwsDictErr = Max[Table[Max[Abs[wsWPsi[[All, n]] - wsTauX[[All, n]] wsOv0[[n]]]]/Max[Abs[wsWPsi[[All, n]]]], {n, 256}]];\nwsTauKA1 = Table[wsEv[wsT[wsGcz, 1, wsTh[[1]]], n]^m, {n, 256}, {m, 0, 3}];\nwsTauKA3 = Table[wsEv[wsT[wsGcz, 1, wsTh[[3]]], n]^m, {n, 256}, {m, 0, 3}];\nwsTauKF2 = Table[If[k == 0, 1, wsEv[wsT[wsGcz, k, wsTh[[2]] + k wsH], n]], {n, 256}, {k, 0, 3}];\nwsTauKF4 = Table[If[k == 0, 1, wsEv[wsT[wsGcz, k, wsTh[[4]] + k wsH], n]], {n, 256}, {k, 0, 3}];\nwsTauY = Table[wsTauKA1[[n, y[[1]] + 1]] wsTauKF2[[n, y[[2]] + 1]] wsTauKA3[[n, y[[3]] + 1]] wsTauKF4[[n, y[[4]] + 1]], {y, wsLabels}, {n, 256}];\nwsResMax = Max[Table[wsRes[wsT2, n], {n, 256}]];\nwsVacIdx = Position[wsWeights, {2, 0, 0, -2}, {1}][[1, 1]];\nGrid[{{\"# weight blocks / # states\", {Length[wsBlocks], Length[wsStates]}},\n  {\"min gap of the combination spectrum (simple joint spectrum)\", N[Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[wsStates[[All, \"comb\"]], {2}]]], 5]},\n  {\"max relative eigen-residual of t₁(θ₂) on the companion kets\", N[wsResMax, 3]},\n  {\"max_n max_x |⟨x|Ψ⟩ − τ_x(Ψ)⟨0|Ψ⟩| / max_x|⟨x|Ψ⟩| (operator identity, round-off only)\", N[wsDictErr, 3]},\n  {\"min |⟨0|Ψ⟩|/‖Ψ‖ over the 256 states\", N[Min[Table[Abs[wsOv0[[n]]]/Norm[wsPsiC[[All, n]]], {n, 256}]], 5]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"28\" data-out-n=\"85\" data-sub-idx=\"24\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"24\" data-sub-end=\"28\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[85]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># weight blocks / # states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min gap of the combination spectrum (simple joint spectrum)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max relative eigen-residual of t₁(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">₂) on the companion kets</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_n max_x |⟨x|Ψ⟩ − </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">_x(Ψ)⟨0|Ψ⟩| / max_x|⟨x|Ψ⟩| (operator identity, round-off only)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min |⟨0|Ψ⟩|/‖Ψ‖ over the 256 states</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.000021503</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">54</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00034083</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
