  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Task 1 — companion-frame image of ⟨W_a^L| [exact]\n\nBras map as ⟨B_Λ| = ⟨B_c|R, i.e. B_Λ ↦ B_c = B_Λ R^{−1}, R^{−1} = V^T (A) ⊗ V^{−1} (F). Per site: (e₁ + a e₄)V^T = v(z₁) + a v(z₄) with v(x) = (x³, x², x, 1) (columns of V = right eigenvectors of G_c), (e₄ − a e₁)V^{−1} = ũ₄ − a ũ₁ with ũ_j = row j of V^{−1} (left eigenvectors of G_c, ũ_j v(z_k) = δ_jk). So\n\n**⟨W_a^L| R^{−1} = [(v(z₁) + a v(z₄)) ⊗ (ũ₄ − a ũ₁)]^{⊗L}, coefficient exactly 1, same sign of a on both site types** (the F-site sign comes from g^{−T} = 1 − aE₄₁). For a = 0 this is the companion Bethe vacuum (v(z₁)⊗ũ₄)^{⊗L} = ⟨0_{w=z}|, NOT the SoV vacuum ⟨0| = e₁⊗e₄⊗… = (λ⊗𝟙)^{⊗L}R^{−1}.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[wsa];\nwsWpairD[a_] := {UnitVector[4, 1] + a UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 4] - a UnitVector[4, 1]};\nwsWaD[a_] := wsProd4 @@ Join[wsWpairD[a], wsWpairD[a]];\nwsvz[j_] := wsV[[All, j]]; wsut[j_] := wsVi[[j]];\nwsWpairC[a_] := {wsvz[1] + a wsvz[4], wsut[4] - a wsut[1]};\nwsWaC[a_] := wsProd4 @@ Join[wsWpairC[a], wsWpairC[a]];\nwsSiteOK = {Expand[(UnitVector[4, 1] + wsa UnitVector[4, 4]) . Transpose[wsV] - (wsvz[1] + wsa wsvz[4])] === {0, 0, 0, 0}, Expand[(UnitVector[4, 4] - wsa UnitVector[4, 1]) . wsVi - (wsut[4] - wsa wsut[1])] === {0, 0, 0, 0}};\nwsT1ok = Union[Expand[wsWaD[wsa] . wsRinv - wsWaC[wsa]]] === {0};\nwsLamW[z_] := Table[1/Product[If[m == j, 1, z[[j]] - z[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}];\nwsVac0ok = wsProd4[wsLamW[wsZ], {1, 1, 1, 1}, wsLamW[wsZ], {1, 1, 1, 1}] . wsRinv == wsVac;\nwsTwo = {Position[wsWeights, {1, 0, 0, -1}, {1}][[1, 1]], Position[wsWeights, {0, 0, 0, 0}, {1}][[3, 1]]};\nwsOvCheck = Table[Module[{d = wsWaD[3/7] . wsPsiD[[All, n]], c = wsWaC[3/7] . wsPsiC[[All, n]]}, {n, wsWeights[[n]], N[d, 12], N[Abs[c/d - 1], 3], N[wsRes[wsT[wsGcz, 1, 3/10], n], 3], N[Norm[wsT[wsLam, 1, 3/10] . wsPsiD[[All, n]] - wsEv[wsT[wsGcz, 1, 3/10], n] wsPsiD[[All, n]]]/Norm[wsPsiD[[All, n]]], 3]}], {n, wsTwo}];\nColumn[{Grid[{{\"per-site maps: (e₁+ae₄)V^T = v(z₁)+a v(z₄), (e₄−ae₁)V⁻¹ = ũ₄−a ũ₁ (symbolic a)\", wsSiteOK},\n   {\"⟨W_a^L| R⁻¹ == [(v(z₁)+a v(z₄))⊗(ũ₄−a ũ₁)]^{⊗2} (symbolic a, exact)\", wsT1ok},\n   {\"SoV vacuum: (λ⊗𝟙)^{⊗2} R⁻¹ == e₁⊗e₄⊗e₁⊗e₄\", wsVac0ok},\n   {\"v(z₁)+a v(z₄) at a = 3/7\", wsWpairC[3/7][[1]]}, {\"ũ₄−a ũ₁ at a = 3/7\", wsWpairC[3/7][[2]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Prepend[wsOvCheck, {\"state n\", \"weight\", \"⟨W_{3/7}|Ψ_Λ⟩\", \"|⟨W_{3/7}R⁻¹|Ψ_c⟩/⟨W_{3/7}|Ψ_Λ⟩ − 1|\", \"eigen-residual of t₁^{G_c}(3/10) on Ψ_c\", \"eigen-residual of t₁^Λ(3/10) on Ψ_Λ (same eigenvalue)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
