  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Task 2 — SoV expansion of ⟨W_a^L|R⁻¹ = Σ_x c_x(a)⟨x| [exact, symbolic a]\n\nc_x(a) = (⟨W_a^L|R⁻¹ · Y)_x, polynomials in a of degree ≤ 4; the aⁿ component is ⟨vac|ρ(E₁₄)ⁿ/n! (n = 0..4) transported to the companion frame. The words are z-independent, the bra is not: under z → κz one has v(κz_j) = κ³ D v(z_j), ũ_j(κz) = κ⁻³ ũ_j(z) D⁻¹ with D = diag(1, κ⁻¹, κ⁻², κ⁻³), so a component of SoV charge q scales as κ^{6−q} and hence **c_x(a; κz) = κ^{6−|x|} c_x(a; z)** (checked below). Rank diagnostics per component: number of words, support by charge |x|, pair-cut rank of the 16×16 matrix c_{(a₁k₂),(a₃k₄)} (= minimal number of products (pair-1 function)×(pair-2 function)), site-flattening ranks, (13)|(24) rank, and the rank over ℚ(r₂,r₄) of the 4×4 matrix m_{a₁a₃}(r₂,r₄) = Σ_{k₂k₄} c_{a₁k₂a₃k₄} r₂^{k₂} r₄^{k₄} (= number of border rows needed in a block-Casoratian determinant, §6).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsCa = Expand[wsWaC[wsa] . wsY];\nwsCn = Table[Coefficient[wsCa, wsa, n], {n, 0, 4}];\nwsSupp[c_] := Flatten[Position[c, Except[0], {1}, Heads -> False]];\nwsByCharge[c_] := Table[Count[wsSupp[c], x_ /; Total[wsLabels[[x]]] == d], {d, 0, 12}];\nwsRk[c_] := Module[{c4 = ArrayReshape[c, {4, 4, 4, 4}]}, {Count[c, Except[0]], MatrixRank[Flatten[c4, {{1, 2}, {3, 4}}]], Table[MatrixRank[Flatten[c4, {{s}, Complement[Range[4], {s}]}]], {s, 4}], MatrixRank[Flatten[c4, {{1, 3}, {2, 4}}]]}];\nwsMmat[c_, r2_, r4_] := Module[{c4 = ArrayReshape[c, {4, 4, 4, 4}]}, Table[Sum[c4[[a1, k2, a3, k4]] r2^(k2 - 1) r4^(k4 - 1), {k2, 4}, {k4, 4}], {a1, 4}, {a3, 4}]];\nClear[wsr2, wsr4];\nwsMrank[c_] := {MatrixRank[wsMmat[c, 5/3, -7/11]], MatrixRank[wsMmat[c, -2/9, 13/4]], MatrixRank[wsMmat[c, wsr2, wsr4]]};\nwsDegTally = Tally[Table[If[wsCa[[x]] === 0, \"zero\", Exponent[wsCa[[x]], wsa, List]], {x, 256}]];\nwsScaleOK = Module[{k = 2/3, Vk, Vik, braK}, Vk = wsVand[k wsZ]; Vik = Inverse[Vk]; braK = wsProd4[Vk[[All, 1]] + wsa Vk[[All, 4]], Vik[[4]] - wsa Vik[[1]], Vk[[All, 1]] + wsa Vk[[All, 4]], Vik[[4]] - wsa Vik[[1]]]; Union[Expand[braK . wsY - Table[k^(6 - Total[wsLabels[[x]]]) wsCa[[x]], {x, 256}]]] === {0}];\nwsCompRows = Table[Join[{\"a^\" <> ToString[n], \"⟨vac|ρ(E₁₄)^\" <> ToString[n] <> \"/\" <> ToString[n] <> \"!\"}, wsRk[wsCn[[n + 1]]], {wsByCharge[wsCn[[n + 1]]], wsMrank[wsCn[[n + 1]]]}], {n, 0, 4}];\nwsGenRow = Join[{\"a = 3/7\", \"full bra\"}, wsRk[wsCa /. wsa -> 3/7], {wsByCharge[wsCa /. wsa -> 3/7], wsMrank[wsCa /. wsa -> 3/7]}];\nColumn[{Grid[{{\"# words with c_x(a) ≠ 0 (symbolic a)\", Count[wsCa, Except[0]]}, {\"exponents of a occurring in c_x(a): tally over x\", wsDegTally}, {\"z-scaling c_x(a; κz) = κ^{6−|x|} c_x(a; z) at κ = 2/3 (symbolic a, exact)\", wsScaleOK}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Prepend[Append[wsCompRows, wsGenRow], {\"component\", \"meaning\", \"# words\", \"pair-cut rank (12)|(34)\", \"site ranks\", \"rank (13)|(24)\", \"support by charge |x| = 0..12\", \"rank of m(r₂,r₄): two generic points, symbolic\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"30\" data-out-n=\"111\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[111]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.09em;vertical-align:-5.795em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.295em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.49em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.095em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.055em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.055em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.61em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.555em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.055em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># words with c_x(a) </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> 0 (symbolic a)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exponents of a occurring in c_x(a): tally over x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">z-scaling c_x(a; </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mord\">z) = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">{6−|x|} c_x(a; z) at </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mord\"> = 2/3 (symbolic a, exact)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.555em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.61em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.555em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t v