class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6625em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.4574em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2427364</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">651015225</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9526em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4051em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9526em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4526em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9526em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[130]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{<0\\_w| eigenbra of t\\_a\\^{}\\{Gc(w)\\}(u): proportional (True) and eigenvalue = sum\\_I prod z\\_i V\\_i(u-(k-1)h) (True), a=1,2,3 x u=\\{3/10,-7/10,5/9\\}} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{max\\_y |<0\\_w|y>/(<0\\_w|0bar> tauTilde\\_y(vac\\_w)) - 1| (exact: 0)} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{<0\\_w| = sum\\_x (sum\\_y <0\\_w|y> M\\_yx) <x|  (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# nonzero words in the SoV expansion of <0\\_w|} & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{<0\\_w|0bar>} & \\frac{651015225}{2427364}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "bbe67a59-ca31-499d-878e-fcf77eb27656"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result [exact].** Both the bra words ⟨x| and the dual ket words |y⟩ are **independent of the companion twist** (Gc(w) and Gc(z) give identical 256×256 matrices), hence so are the Gram matrix and the measure M. ⟨0_w| is an exact eigenbra of t_a^{Gc(w)}(u) (a = 1,2,3, three u each) with eigenvalue τ_a(u) = Σ_{|I|=a} ∏_k w_{i_k}V_{i_k}(u−(k−1)h), and therefore ⟨0_w|y⟩ = ⟨0_w|0̄⟩ ∏_s f_s(y_s) with f_A(m) = τ₁(θ_A)^m, f_F(n) = τ_n(θ_F+nh) — an exact product over sites (error 0 for all 256 y). The expansion ⟨0_w| = Σ_x (Σ_y⟨0_w|y⟩M_{yx})⟨x| is exact and **dense** (256 words).\n\nNext: express the τ̃_y(vac_w) through Q-functions of the vacuum of twist w (mirror dictionary of `sov_l4.py` §8).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsMu = {2, 0, 0, -2};\nwsPe[c_, x_] := Sum[c[[k]] x^(k - 1), {k, Length[c]}];\n(* polynomial part q_i of the vacuum Q-function of twist zz: Baxter  sum_a (-1)^a zz_i^-a tau_a(u) q(u-a h) prod_{b=a}^{3} V4(u-b h) = 0, minimal degree 2+mu_i *)\nwsVacQpoly[zz_, i_] := Module[{d = 2 + wsMu[[i]], cols, n, mat, ns, uu},\n  cols = Table[CoefficientList[Expand[Sum[(-1)^a zz[[i]]^(-a) wsTauVac[zz][a, uu] (uu - a wsH)^k Product[wsVvac[4, uu - b wsH], {b, a, 3}], {a, 0, 4}]], uu], {k, 0, d}];\n  n = Max[1, Length /@ cols];\n  mat = Transpose[PadRight[#, n] & /@ cols];\n  ns = NullSpace[mat];\n  {If[Length[ns] == 1, ns[[1]]/ns[[1, -1]], $Failed], Length[ns]}];\nwsFvac[k_, u_] := Which[k == 1, 1, k == 2, Product[u - wsTh[[s]], {s, {2, 4}}], k == 3, Product[(u - wsTh[[s]]) (u - wsTh[[s]] - wsH), {s, {2, 4}}], True, Product[(u - wsTh[[s]]) (u - wsTh[[s]] - wsH) (u - wsTh[[s]] - 2 wsH), {s, {2, 4}}] Product[u - wsTh[[s]] + wsH, {s, {1, 3}}]];\nwsVacQ[zz_] := Module[{qs, qI, uu, rem = 0},\n  qs = Table[wsVacQpoly[zz, i], {i, 4}];\n  If[AnyTrue[qs, #[[1]] === $Failed &], Return[{$Failed, qs}]];\n  qI = Association @@ Table[Module[{k = Length[wsI], P, qd},\n     P = Expand[Det[Table[zz[[i]]^(k - 1 - s) wsPe[qs[[i, 1]], uu - s wsH], {s, 0, k - 1}, {i, wsI}]]];\n     qd = PolynomialQuotientRemainder[P, wsFvac[k, uu], uu]; rem = Max[rem, If[qd[[2]] === 0, 0, 1]];\n     wsI -> CoefficientList[qd[[1]], uu]], {wsI, Subsets[Range[4], {1, 4}]}];\n  {qI, {qs[[All, 2]], rem}}];\nwsQw = AbsoluteTiming[wsVacQw = wsVacQ[wsWt]];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", wsQw[[1]]}, {\"nullity of the Baxter system for q_1..q_4 (1 = unique polynomial solution)\", wsVacQw[[2, 1]]}, {\"Casoratian polynomial parts divisible by F_k (remainder 0 for all subsets)\", wsVacQw[[2, 2]] == 0}, {\"degrees of q_1..q_4\", Length /@ (wsVacQw[[1]] /@ {{1}, {2}, {3}, {4}}) - 1}, {\"degrees of q_{123}, q_{124}, q_{134}, q_{234}, q_{1234}\", Length /@ (wsVacQw[[1]] /@ {{1, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 4}, {1, 3, 4}, {2, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 3, 4}}) - 1}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
