      {
       "data": "Out[257]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 0.0459038\\\\\\hline\\text{nullity of the Baxter system for q\\_1..q\\_4 (1 = unique polynomial solution)} & \\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{Casoratian polynomial parts divisible by F\\_k (remainder 0 for all subsets)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{degrees of q\\_1..q\\_4} & \\left\\{4,2,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{degrees of q\\_\\{123\\}, q\\_\\{124\\}, q\\_\\{134\\}, q\\_\\{234\\}, q\\_\\{1234\\}} & \\left\\{4,2,2,0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
