      {
       "data": "Out[283]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{bra-side dictionary on the vacuum Q's of twist w: F: tau\\_1(th\\_F)\\^{}k = (Qt\\_j(th\\_F)/Qt\\_j(th\\_F - h))\\^{}k (all j), A: tau\\_a(th\\_A - h) = D\\_a/D\\_0 (all 4 triples); max rel. error (F, A) [exact]} & \\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{same at twist z} & \\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
