  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Task 3 — ⟨W_a^L|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩ = Σ_x c_x(a) τ_x(Ψ): sectors, exactness on 256 states, structure of the coefficients\n\nWeights: the aⁿ component of ⟨W_a| has weight (2−n,0,0,n−2), so only eigenstates Ψ_Λ of that weight overlap with it (n = 2 − w₁); all other states have ⟨W_a|Ψ⟩ = 0 identically. The expansion c_x(a) is the unique expansion of the bra on all 256 states (the 256 τ-monomials are independent functions on the 256 states), so it encodes the vanishing on the other sectors.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsSect = Table[With[{w = wsWeights[[n]]}, If[w[[2]] == 0 && w[[3]] == 0 && w[[1]] + w[[4]] == 0, 2 - w[[1]], None]], {n, 256}];\nwsSectTally = Sort[Tally[wsSect]];\nwsWaCn = Table[Coefficient[wsWaC[wsa], wsa, n], {n, 0, 4}];\nwsDirN = Table[wsWaCn[[n + 1]] . wsPsiC, {n, 0, 4}];\nwsSovN = Table[(wsCn[[n + 1]] . wsTauX) wsOv0, {n, 0, 4}];\nwsCompErr = Table[Max[Abs[wsDirN[[n + 1]] - wsSovN[[n + 1]]]]/Max[Abs[wsDirN[[n + 1]]]], {n, 0, 4}];\nwsInSec = Table[Max[Abs[Pick[wsDirN[[n + 1]], Table[If[wsSect[[k]] === n, 1, 0], {k, 256}], 1]]], {n, 0, 4}];\nwsOffSec = Table[Max[Abs[Pick[wsDirN[[n + 1]], Table[If[wsSect[[k]] === n, 0, 1], {k, 256}], 1]]], {n, 0, 4}];\nwsOvA = Table[(wsWaC[3/7] . wsPsiC[[All, k]]), {k, 256}];\nwsOvA1 = Table[(wsWaC[1] . wsPsiC[[All, k]]), {k, 256}];\nwsTorus = Max[Table[If[IntegerQ[wsSect[[k]]], Abs[wsOvA[[k]] - (3/7)^wsSect[[k]] wsOvA1[[k]]]/Abs[wsOvA1[[k]]], Abs[wsOvA[[k]]]], {k, 256}]];\nwsFullErr = Max[Table[Abs[wsOvA[[k]] - (wsCa /. wsa -> 3/7) . wsTauX[[All, k]] wsOv0[[k]]], {k, 256}]]/Max[Abs[wsOvA]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{n, Count[wsSect, n], N[wsInSec[[n + 1]], 4], N[wsOffSec[[n + 1]], 3], N[wsCompErr[[n + 1]], 3]}, {n, 0, 4}], {\"n\", \"# states of weight (2-n,0,0,n-2)\", \"max_in-sector |<vac|rho(E14)^n/n!|Psi_c>|\", \"max_off-sector |.| (must vanish)\", \"max |direct - sum_x c^(n)_x tau_x <0|Psi>| / max|direct|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
