  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Task 5 — global Borel rotations of the SoV vacuum ⟨0| (companion frame): word support [exact]\n\nA diagonal-frame group element g acts on bras as A: v → v g, F: u → u g^{−T}; in the companion frame (bra_c = bra_Λ R⁻¹) the same rotation is g_c = V^{−T} g V^T on A sites and V g^{−T} V^{−1} on F sites. We rotate the companion-frame SoV vacuum ⟨0| = e₁⊗e₄⊗e₁⊗e₄ by g = 1 + bE_ij (global, same g on all 4 sites) and count the words.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsEg[i_, j_] := Normal[wsE[i, j]];\n(* per-site rotated vectors: A: e1 g_c, F: e4 g_c^{-T}; g_c = V^{-T} g V^T (diagonal-frame generator transported), F matrix V g^{-T} V^{-1} *)\nwsRotBra[i_, j_, b_] := Module[{g = IdentityMatrix[4] + b wsEg[i, j], gi = IdentityMatrix[4] - b wsEg[i, j], gA, gF}, gA = Transpose[wsVi] . g . Transpose[wsV]; gF = wsV . Transpose[gi] . wsVi; wsProd4[UnitVector[4, 1] . gA, UnitVector[4, 4] . gF, UnitVector[4, 1] . gA, UnitVector[4, 4] . gF]];\nwsRotBraCF[i_, j_, b_] := Module[{g = IdentityMatrix[4] + b wsEg[i, j], gi = IdentityMatrix[4] - b wsEg[i, j]}, wsProd4[UnitVector[4, 1] . g, UnitVector[4, 4] . Transpose[gi], UnitVector[4, 1] . g, UnitVector[4, 4] . Transpose[gi]]];\n(* machinery test: the companion image of the rotated diagonal-frame vacuum is <W_a| R^-1: per site (e1 V^T) g_c = e1 g V^T etc. *)\nwsRotTest = Module[{gA, gF, g = IdentityMatrix[4] + wsa wsEg[1, 4], gi = IdentityMatrix[4] - wsa wsEg[1, 4]}, gA = Transpose[wsVi] . g . Transpose[wsV]; gF = wsV . Transpose[gi] . wsVi; Union[Expand[wsProd4[(UnitVector[4, 1] . Transpose[wsV]) . gA, (UnitVector[4, 4] . wsVi) . gF, (UnitVector[4, 1] . Transpose[wsV]) . gA, (UnitVector[4, 4] . wsVi) . gF] - wsWaC[wsa]]] === {0}];\nwsBorel = {{1, 2}, {3, 4}, {1, 4}, {1, 3}, {2, 4}, {2, 3}};\nwsRotCount[f_] := Table[Module[{cc = Expand[f[ij[[1]], ij[[2]], wsb] . wsY]}, Join[{\"E\" <> ToString[ij[[1]]] <> ToString[ij[[2]]]}, Table[Count[Coefficient[cc, wsb, k], Except[0]], {k, 0, 4}], {Count[cc, x_ /; x =!= 0 && x =!= 0.]}]], {ij, wsBorel}];\nwsRotRows = wsRotCount[wsRotBra];\nwsRotRowsCF = wsRotCount[wsRotBraCF];\nColumn[{Grid[{{\"rotation machinery: <vac_diag|R^-1 . rho_c(1 + a E14) == <W_a|R^-1 (symbolic a, exact)\", wsRotTest}}, Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Prepend[wsRotRows, {\"diagonal-frame generator, transported\", \"# words at b^0\", \"b^1\", \"b^2\", \"b^3\", \"b^4\", \"# words (b^k, any k)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Prepend[wsRotRowsCF, {\"generator acting directly in the companion frame (contrast)\", \"# words at b^0\", \"b^1\", \"b^2\", \"b^3\", \"b^4\", \"# words (b^k, any k)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"66\" data-out-n=\"391\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[391]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:18.13em;vertical-align:-8.815em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.315em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.915em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.49em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rotation machinery: &lt;vac_diag|R</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstru