      {
       "data": "Out[391]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rotation machinery: <vac\\_diag|R\\^{}-1 . rho\\_c(1 + a E14) == <W\\_a|R\\^{}-1 (symbolic a, exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{diagonal-frame generator, transported} & \\text{\\# words at b\\^{}0} & \\text{b\\^{}1} & \\text{b\\^{}2} & \\text{b\\^{}3} & \\text{b\\^{}4} & \\text{\\# words (b\\^{}k, any k)}\\\\\\hline\\text{E12} & 1 & 30 & 140 & 236 & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{E34} & 1 & 30 & 140 & 236 & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{E14} & 1 & 30 & 140 & 236 & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{E13} & 1 & 30 & 140 & 236 & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{E24} & 1 & 30 & 140 & 236 & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{E23} & 1 & 30 & 140 & 236 & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{generator acting directly in the companion frame (contrast)} & \\text{\\# words at b\\^{}0} & \\text{b\\^{}1} & \\text{b\\^{}2} & \\text{b\\^{}3} & \\text{b\\^{}4} & \\text{\\# words (b\\^{}k, any k)}\\\\\\hline\\text{E12} & 1 & 4 & 8 & 0 & 0 & 13\\\\\\hline\\text{E34} & 1 & 2 & 1 & 0 & 0 & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{E14} & 1 & 16 & 36 & 16 & 1 & 70\\\\\\hline\\text{E13} & 1 & 9 & 23 & 0 & 0 & 33\\\\\\hline\\text{E24} & 1 & 3 & 1 & 0 & 0 & 5\\\\\\hline\\text{E23} & 1 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\… [latex truncated: 1230 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1bcafc42-2187-456f-b995-fcb95c684d28"
