  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8b. Eigenbra property of the n = 0 and n = 4 components, and the pair-product candidates [exact + hp]\n\nn = 0: (v(z₁)⊗ũ₄)^{⊗2} = companion Bethe vacuum; n = 4: (v(z₄)⊗ũ₁)^{⊗2}, an eigenbra with the vacuum-type eigenvalue with z → (z₄,z₂,z₃,z₁). Candidate forms for the full bra at a = 3/7: product over pairs of one-pair overlaps (the other pair at the SoV vacuum), and a linear combination of them.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsPerm4 = {wsZ[[4]], wsZ[[2]], wsZ[[3]], wsZ[[1]]};\nwsEigN = Table[With[{r = wsBraEv[wsWaCn[[n + 1]], wsT[wsGcz, 1, u]]}, {n, u, r[[2]], r[[1]] == wsTauVac[If[n == 0, wsZ, wsPerm4]][1, u]}], {n, {0, 4}}, {u, {3/10, -7/10}}];\nwsAv = wsvz[1] + (3/7) wsvz[4]; wsFu = wsut[4] - (3/7) wsut[1]; wsE1v = UnitVector[4, 1]; wsE4v = UnitVector[4, 4];\nwsBfull = wsProd4[wsAv, wsFu, wsAv, wsFu]; wsBp1 = wsProd4[wsAv, wsFu, wsE1v, wsE4v]; wsBp2 = wsProd4[wsE1v, wsE4v, wsAv, wsFu];\nwsGa = Table[(wsBfull . wsPsiC[[All, k]])/wsOv0[[k]], {k, 256}]; wsP1a = Table[(wsBp1 . wsPsiC[[All, k]])/wsOv0[[k]], {k, 256}]; wsP2a = Table[(wsBp2 . wsPsiC[[All, k]])/wsOv0[[k]], {k, 256}];\nwsActive = Select[Range[256], Abs[wsGa[[#]]] > 10^-30 &];\nwsRatioAbs = Abs[wsGa[[wsActive]]/(wsP1a[[wsActive]] wsP2a[[wsActive]])];\nwsAmat = Transpose[{wsP1a[[wsActive]], wsP2a[[wsActive]], ConstantArray[1, Length[wsActive]]}];\nwsLSQsol = LeastSquares[wsAmat, wsGa[[wsActive]]];\nwsLSQres = Norm[wsAmat . wsLSQsol - wsGa[[wsActive]]]/Norm[wsGa[[wsActive]]];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[Flatten[wsEigN, 1], {\"n\", \"u\", \"proportional to <bra|t_1^{Gc(z)}(u)\", \"eigenvalue = vacuum formula (z for n=0, (z4,z2,z3,z1) for n=4)\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[{{\"# states with <W_a|Psi> != 0 (a = 3/7)\", Length[wsActive]}, {\"G/(P1 P2): min, max |.| over those states\", N[{Min[wsRatioAbs], Max[wsRatioAbs]}, 5]}, {\"least squares G = c1 P1 + c2 P2 + c0: relative residual\", N[wsLSQres, 4]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
