  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Summary of results (2026-10-13)\n\n**Run status.** All cells were run top to bottom in the (restarted) shared kernel; the first kernel was lost at ~06:50 UTC (another agent's restart), cells 15–28 were then first obtained with the exact python cross-check `checks/session-2026-10-13/wasov/` (Fractions / mpmath 50 digits) and afterwards **re-run and reproduced in this notebook** (ranks, supports, constants, W_w, sectors, Task 5 counts all identical; W_w in Mathematica 60 digits agrees to < 1e-44, python 1.6e-39). Notes: `notes/agent-2026-10-13-Wa-sov.md`.\n\n**Task 1 [exact].** ⟨W_a^L|R⁻¹ = [(v(z₁)+a v(z₄))⊗(ũ₄−aũ₁)]^{⊗2}, coefficient exactly 1, symbolic a (cell 9); ⟨W_a|Ψ_Λ⟩ = ⟨W_aR⁻¹|Ψ_c⟩ on eigenstates; SoV vacuum map (λ⊗𝟙)^{⊗2}R⁻¹ = e₁⊗e₄⊗e₁⊗e₄ checked.\n\n**Task 2 [exact].** c_x(a) polynomials of degree 4; **all 256 words nonzero in every component aⁿ**, every c_x(a) contains all powers a⁰..a⁴; support by charge 1,4,10,20,31,40,44,40,31,20,10,4,1 (full); c_x(a;κz) = κ^{6−|x|}c_x(a;z). Pair-cut ranks 11,13,16,13,11; (13)|(24) ranks 4,12,16,12,4; A–A matrix ranks 2,2,4,2,2 (n = 0..4); generic a: 16/16/4. The n = 0, 4 components are exact eigenbras of t^{G_c(z)} (n = 4: vacuum eigenvalue with z → (z₄,z₂,z₃,z₁)), n = 1,2,3 are not; no simple map between components.\n\n**Task 3.** Sectors (weight (2−n,0,0,n−2)): 1,12,28,12,1 states, 54 of 256 overlap with ⟨W_a|; SoV sums = direct overlaps on all 256 states (< 1e-47, 60 digits), off-sector < 1e-49. ⟨W^{(n)}|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩ = Σ τ_{a₁}(θ₁−h) m_{a₁a₃}(r₂,r₄) τ_{a₃}(θ₃−h) with rank_{Q(r₂,r₄)} m = 2 (n = 0,1,3,4), 4 (n = 2, generic a): sum of 2 (resp. 4) products of bordered 4×4 Casoratians, border rows polynomial of bidegree ≤ (3,3) in (τ₁(θ₂),τ₁(θ₄)); equivalently one 8×8 bordered determinant with 2 border rows (n ≠ 2) — no compression for the singlet sector n = 2. Entries of m share a common bidegree-(2,2) factor for n = 0,4 only. Excluded: product over pairs of bordered Casoratians (pair-cut rank 11–16; G/(P₁P₂) ranges over [1.0e-6, 10.0] on the 54 states), αP₁+βP₂+γ (LSQ residual 0.79), GLMR/2603-type bracket determinant (no measure for the mixed chain). No closed Q-form for the a¹ component beyond the above.\n\n**Task 4 [exact + hp].** Bra and ket words are twist-independent; ⟨0_w| is an exact eigenbra of t^{G_c(w)} with the vacuum eigenvalues; ⟨0_w|y⟩ = ⟨0_w|0̄⟩∏_s f_s(y_s) exactly (all 256 y); mirror dictionary on the vacuum Q's of twist w with twist- and state-independent exact constants N₀ = const/(det G)ⁿ: A₁ 25947/603680, A₃ 391645/298144, F₂ (n=1,2,3) −459/19250, −26625213/5929000000, −1498387112001/130438000000000, F₄ −3589/35840, −15407577/7064780800, 229218523029/2785219182592000 (identical from vac(z), vac(w), vac(w₂), all 256 y, error 0). **W_w(Ψ) = Σ_{x,y}τ̃_y(vac_w)M_{yx}τ_x(Ψ) = ⟨0_w|Ψ_z⟩/(⟨0_w|0̄⟩⟨0|Ψ_z⟩)** on all 256 states (< 1e-44); for w = z it vanishes on the 255 non-vacuum states (< 1e-45). ⟨W_a|y⟩ does not factorise: site ranks 4,4,4,4 (n = 1,2,3), 4,3,4,3 (generic a); rank 1 only for n = 0,4.\n\n**Task 5 [exact].** Diagonal-frame Borel generators transported to the companion frame: all six give 1,30,140,236,256 words at b⁰..b⁴ (dense). Companion-frame generators: E₁₂ 13 words, E₃₄ 4, E₂₄ 5, E₁₃ 33, E₁₄ 70, E₂₃ 1.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
