      {
       "data": "Out[410]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{a = v4/v1 minus Moebius map (symbolic)} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{-u1/u4 minus Moebius map (symbolic)} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{u2, u3 (must vanish)} & \\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{BPS: v.u = v1u1 + v4u4 (u2=u3=0) = 0} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{a(w1=z1), a(w1=z4), limit w1->z4+, limit w1->infinity} & \\left\\{0,\\mathrm{ComplexInfinity},\\infty ,-\\frac{245}{76}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
