  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.2 Full Q-chain at generic θ, z: ⟨W_a^L|Ψ⟩ = (v₁u₄)⁻² ⟨0_w|0̄⟩ ⟨0|Ψ⟩ 𝕎_w(Ψ), 𝕎_w = Σ τ̃_y(vac_w) M_{yx} τ_x(Ψ), w = (w₁,z₂,z₃,w₄), a = a(w₁)\n\nFor each w₁ (w₄ = 5/9): (i) the diagonal-frame image of the companion bra ⟨0_w|R equals (v⊗u)^{⊗2} exactly; (ii) τ̃_y(vac_w) from the dual vacuum Q's of twist w (mirror dictionary, constants N₀ of §6); (iii) the identity on the 54 states of the five sectors; (iv) the values of the RHS on the other weights (nonzero only where an A-site e₂/e₃ can be compensated).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsWwCheck[w1_, w4_] := Module[{ww = {w1, wsZ[[2]], wsZ[[3]], w4}, Vw, vw, uw, b0, b0y, tY, Wvec, vd, ud, aa, lhs, rhs, act, oth, diagOK, sc},\n  Vw = wsVand[ww]; vw = Vw[[All, 1]]; uw = Inverse[Vw][[4]];\n  b0 = wsProd4[vw, uw, vw, uw]; b0y = b0 . wsYk;\n  vd = wsVdD[wsZ, ww]; ud = wsUdD[wsZ, ww];\n  diagOK = (b0 . wsR == wsProd4[vd, ud, vd, ud]);\n  tY = wsTauYQ[ww]; Wvec = N[tY, 60] . wsMn60;\n  aa = wsMob[wsZ, w1];\n  lhs = Table[wsWaC[aa] . wsPsiC[[All, k]], {k, 256}];\n  rhs = Table[b0y[[1]] wsOv0[[k]] (Wvec . wsTauX[[All, k]])/(vd[[1]] ud[[4]])^2, {k, 256}];\n  act = Select[Range[256], IntegerQ[wsSect[[#]]] &]; oth = Complement[Range[256], act];\n  sc = Max[Abs[lhs[[act]]]];\n  {w1, aa, diagOK, N[Max[Abs[lhs[[act]] - rhs[[act]]]]/sc, 3], N[sc, 5], N[Max[Abs[lhs[[oth]]]], 3], N[Max[Abs[rhs[[oth]]]]/sc, 4], Count[Abs[rhs[[oth]]]/sc, x_ /; x > 10^-20]}];\nwsWwRows = {wsWwCheck[7/5, 5/9], wsWwCheck[11/3, 5/9], wsWwCheck[-5/4, 2/7]};\nGrid[Prepend[wsWwRows, {\"w1\", \"a(w1)\", \"<0_w|R == (vd x ud)^2 (exact)\", \"max_54 |LHS - RHS|/max|LHS|\", \"max |<W_a|Psi>| (54 states)\", \"max |<W_a|Psi>| off-sector\", \"max |RHS|/scale off-sector\", \"# off-sector states with RHS != 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
