     "id": "99675c99-3de9-4dfb-a187-a6e8162523f4"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.3 The w₁ → ∞ limit: an F-only bra\n\nFor w = (w₁,z₂,z₃,w₄), w₁ → ∞: v(w₁) → w₁³ e₁ (companion frame) and ũ_w → (0,1,−s,p)/((w₄−z₂)(w₄−z₃)), s = z₂+z₃, p = z₂z₃ (coefficients of (x−z₂)(x−z₃)), a → κ₀ = −(z₁−z₂)(z₁−z₃)/((z₄−z₂)(z₄−z₃)). So on all (μ,0,0,−μ) states ⟨W_{κ₀}|Ψ⟩ = ⟨e₁⊗ũ⊗e₁⊗ũ|Ψ_c⟩/(λ₁²((z₄−z₂)(z₄−z₃))²) with ũ = (0,1,−s,p), and ⟨W_a|Ψ⟩ = (a/κ₀)ⁿ⟨W_{κ₀}|Ψ⟩. The bra e₁⊗ũ⊗e₁⊗ũ has A sites at the SoV vacuum vector and F-site vectors in span(e₂,e₃,e₄), hence only words with a₁ = a₃ = 0, k₂,k₄ ≤ 2 (F-only).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsKap0 = -((wsZ[[1]] - wsZ[[2]]) (wsZ[[1]] - wsZ[[3]]))/((wsZ[[4]] - wsZ[[2]]) (wsZ[[4]] - wsZ[[3]]));\nwsLam1 = 1/Product[wsZ[[1]] - wsZ[[m]], {m, 2, 4}];\nwsUt = {0, 1, -(wsZ[[2]] + wsZ[[3]]), wsZ[[2]] wsZ[[3]]};\nwsBinf = wsProd4[UnitVector[4, 1], wsUt, UnitVector[4, 1], wsUt];\nwsNormInf = wsLam1^2 ((wsZ[[4]] - wsZ[[2]]) (wsZ[[4]] - wsZ[[3]]))^2;\nwsCinf = wsBinf . wsY;\nwsLhsInf = Table[wsWaC[wsKap0] . wsPsiC[[All, k]], {k, 256}];\nwsRhsInf = Table[(wsBinf . wsPsiC[[All, k]])/wsNormInf, {k, 256}];\nwsActive54 = Select[Range[256], IntegerQ[wsSect[[#]]] &];\nwsInfErr = Max[Abs[wsLhsInf[[wsActive54]] - wsRhsInf[[wsActive54]]]]/Max[Abs[wsLhsInf[[wsActive54]]]];\nwsInfWords = wsLabels[[wsSupp[wsCinf]]];\nGrid[{{\"kappa0 = a(w1 = infinity)\", wsKap0}, {\"max_54 |<W_kappa0|Psi> - <e1 ut e1 ut|Psi_c>/norm| / max\", N[wsInfErr, 3]}, {\"# words in the SoV expansion of e1 (x) ut (x) e1 (x) ut\", Length[wsInfWords]}, {\"words (a1,k2,a3,k4)\", wsInfWords}, {\"max over the other 202 states of |RHS| (not required to vanish)\", N[Max[Abs[wsRhsInf[[Complement[Range[256], wsActive54]]]]], 4]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
