  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.4 Closed form on the sectors: a bidegree-(2,2) polynomial in the two F-site single-Q ratios\n\nWith ρ₂ = τ₁(θ₂)/(hθ₁₂θ₂₃(θ₂₄−h)), ρ₄ = τ₁(θ₄)/(hθ₁₄θ₂₄θ₃₄), ν = θ₂₄ the F-only coefficients of e₁⊗e_a⊗e₁⊗e_b (a,b ∈ {2,3,4}) are\nP₄₄ = 1, P₄₃ = ρ₄ − (h/ν)ρ₂, P₃₄ = ρ₂, P₃₃ = (ν/(ν+h))ρ₂ρ₄, P₄₂ = ρ₄² − (h/ν)(1+h/(ν+h))ρ₂ρ₄ − (h/ν)((ν−h)/ν)ρ₂², P₂₄ = ((ν−h)/ν)ρ₂² + (h/(ν+h))ρ₂ρ₄, P₃₂ = (ν/(ν+h))ρ₂ρ₄² − (h/(ν+h))ρ₂²ρ₄, P₂₃ = (ν/(ν+h))ρ₂²ρ₄, P₂₂ = (ν/(ν+h))²ρ₂²ρ₄² (read off at the standard point and reproduced exactly at a second point (h,θ) = (2/3,(3/11,−5/7,9/13,−13/9)) in `checks/session-2026-10-13/wasov/run12.py`; the e₃,e₄ part is the reports §6 formula). Then for Ψ of weight (2−n,0,0,n−2): ⟨W_a|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩ = (a/κ₀)ⁿ Σ_{ab} ũ_aũ_b P_{ab}(ρ₂,ρ₄)/(λ₁²((z₄−z₂)(z₄−z₃))²), ũ = (0,1,−(z₂+z₃),z₂z₃).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsPab[nu_, h_][r2_, r4_] := {{(nu/(nu + h))^2 r2^2 r4^2, nu/(nu + h) r2^2 r4, (nu - h)/nu r2^2 + h/(nu + h) r2 r4}, {nu/(nu + h) r2 r4^2 - h/(nu + h) r2^2 r4, nu/(nu + h) r2 r4, r2}, {r4^2 - (h/nu) (1 + h/(nu + h)) r2 r4 - (h/nu) (nu - h)/nu r2^2, r4 - (h/nu) r2, 1}};\nwsClosed[k_, a_] := Module[{th = wsTh, h = wsH, nu, rho2, rho4, P, n = wsSect[[k]]},\n  nu = th[[2]] - th[[4]];\n  rho2 = wsR2[[k]]/(h (th[[1]] - th[[2]]) (th[[2]] - th[[3]]) (nu - h)); rho4 = wsR4[[k]]/(h (th[[1]] - th[[4]]) nu (th[[3]] - th[[4]]));\n  P = wsPab[nu, h][rho2, rho4];\n  (a/wsKap0)^n (wsUt[[{2, 3, 4}]] . P . wsUt[[{2, 3, 4}]])/wsNormInf];\nwsClosedErr = Table[Abs[wsOvA[[k]]/wsOv0[[k]] - wsClosed[k, 3/7]], {k, wsActive54}];\nwsClosedScale = Max[Abs[wsOvA[[wsActive54]]/wsOv0[[wsActive54]]]];\nGrid[{{\"# states\", Length[wsActive54]}, {\"max_54 |<W_a|Psi>/<0|Psi> - closed form (a = 3/7)| / max|G|\", N[Max[wsClosedErr]/wsClosedScale, 3]}, {\"scale max|G|\", N[wsClosedScale, 5]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
