      {
       "data": "Out[466]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{\\# states} & 54\\\\\\hline\\text{max\\_54 |<W\\_a|Psi>/<0|Psi> - closed form (a = 3/7)| / max|G|} & 0.\\times 10^{-47}\\\\\\hline\\text{scale max|G|} & 0.51324\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
