  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.5 w₁-dependence of the Q-sum: τ̃_y(vac_w) is a polynomial in w₁ independent of w₄, and which (x,y) terms carry the top power\n\nAt w = (w₁,z₂,z₃,w₄) the vacuum eigenvalues at the ket points collapse (V₂ = V₃, V₁ = 0 at θ_F, V₂,V₃,V₄ = 0 at θ_A, V₄(θ_F+h) = 0): τ̃ at an A site = (w₁V₁(θ_A))^m (monomial), at an F site n = 1,2,3 affine in w₁ (n = 3: monomial w₁z₂z₃·…), independent of w₄, depending on w₂,w₃ only through s = w₂+w₃, p = w₂w₃. So 𝕎_w(Ψ) = Σ_{x,y} τ̃_y M_{yx} τ_x is a polynomial in w₁ of degree ≤ 3+3+1+1 = 8; on the (μ,0,0,−μ) sectors it equals [λ₁(z₄−z₂)(z₄−z₃)(w₁−z₂)(w₁−z₃)(w₁−z₄)²]² a(w₁)ⁿ Γ_Ψ with Γ_Ψ = ⟨W₁|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩, i.e. ∝ (w₁−z₂)²(w₁−z₃)²(w₁−z₄)^{4−n}(w₁−z₁)ⁿ.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsw1s = Symbol[\"wsW1sym\"]; wsw4s = Symbol[\"wsW4sym\"];\nwsTauYsym = Table[Expand[wsTauYvac[{wsw1s, wsZ[[2]], wsZ[[3]], wsw4s}][y]], {y, wsLabels}];\nwsW4free = And @@ (D[#, wsw4s] === 0 & /@ wsTauYsym);\nwsDegY = Exponent[#, wsw1s] & /@ wsTauYsym;\nwsCw1 = Expand[wsTauYsym . wsM];\nwsCw1Pow = Table[Coefficient[#, wsw1s, j] & /@ wsCw1, {j, 0, 9}];\nwsTopY = wsLabels[[Flatten[Position[wsDegY, Max[wsDegY]]]]];\nwsPowCounts = Table[Count[wsCw1Pow[[j + 1]], Except[0]], {j, 0, 9}];\nwsTopWords = wsLabels[[wsSupp[wsCw1Pow[[9]]]]];\nwsTopRatio = DeleteDuplicates[Select[Table[If[wsCinf[[i]] === 0, 0, wsCw1Pow[[9, i]]/wsCinf[[i]]], {i, 256}], # =!= 0 &]];\nGrid[{{\"tauTilde_y(vac_w) independent of w4 (all 256 y)\", wsW4free}, {\"max degree in w1 over y; # y with max degree and their labels\", {Max[wsDegY], Length[wsTopY], wsTopY}}, {\"# nonzero words of the coefficient of w1^j in sum_y tauTilde_y M_yx, j = 0..9\", wsPowCounts}, {\"words of the w1^8 coefficient\", wsTopWords}, {\"ratio (w1^8 coefficient)/(F-only bra e1 ut e1 ut expansion), distinct values\", wsTopRatio}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"81\" data-out-n=\"477\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"39\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[477]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:25.2402em;vertical-align:-12.3501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.8501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.8501em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:25.2002em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-12.3501em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.8501em;\"><span style=\"top:-19.6601em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tauTilde_y(vac_w) independent of w4 (all 256 y)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.6501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max degree in w1 over y; # y with max degree and their labels</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span clas