  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.7 Even bridge M = 1 at L = 2: C = lim K_κ(τ_Ψε) · ⟨W_a|Ψ_ε⟩/(1−κz₁)² with ⟨W_a|Ψ⟩ replaced by the Q-closed form\n\nz = 1+εφ, φ = (9/10,7/20,3/5,−11/10) (φ₂ ≠ φ₃ so that ⟨0|Ψ⟩ exists; K_κ with y = (z₂+z₃)/2 as in lpairs Task 3c), θ = (θ_F1+2h,θ_F1,θ_F2+2h,θ_F2), θ_F = ε(0,37/100), c = 3/10, κ = 1−cε, a = (φ₁−c)/(φ₁−φ₄); the equivalent twisted-vacuum parameter is w₁ = 1+εω₁ with a(w₁) = a. Unit-norm Ψ_ε (|C| compared with 1/√40 = 0.158114 and 1/√24 = 0.204124); hp (90 digits), exact rational operators, no memoisation. K_κ = s² + κ s[X₁/(h²λ₁) + X₂/(2h⁴yλ₂) + X₃/(6h⁵y²λ₃)] + κ²X₃X₁/(24h⁷y²λ₁λ₃), X₁ = τ₁(θ₂), X₂ = τ₂(u₀), X₃ = reduced τ₃(u₀), u₀ = θ_F1+h, λ_k the pair-2 localisation constants.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsPre3red[u_, th_] := Times @@ DeleteCases[Flatten[Table[If[wsTypes[[s]] == \"A\", {u - th[[s]] - wsH, u - th[[s]] - 2 wsH}, {u - th[[s]], u - th[[s]] - wsH}], {s, 4}]], 0];\nwsLamK[k_, u_, thE_] := Times @@ DeleteCases[Join[Table[u - thE[[3]] - j wsH, {j, 0, k - 1}], {u - thE[[4]] - k wsH}, Table[u - thE[[4]] - j wsH, {j, 0, k - 2}]], 0];\nwsEpsRun[eps_, phi_, thdir_, c_] := Module[{zz = 1 + eps phi, thF = eps thdir, thE, G, t1f, comb, T2, T4, X2op, X3op, u0, l1, l2, l3, h = wsH, lam, bra0, a, kap, y, s, nrm0, kap0, nrm, nu, ut, blk, vals, vecs, braW, Nk, Gc0},\n  thE = {thF[[1]] + 2 h, thF[[1]], thF[[2]] + 2 h, thF[[2]]}; G = DiagonalMatrix[zz];\n  t1f[u_] := wsBuild[G, 1, u, thE];\n  comb = t1f[3/11] + 7/10 wsPre[3, -5/7, thE] wsBuild[G, 3, -5/7, thE] - 3/13 wsPre[2, 2/9, thE] wsBuild[G, 2, 2/9, thE];\n  T2 = t1f[thE[[2]]]; T4 = t1f[thE[[4]]]; u0 = thE[[2]] + h;\n  X2op = wsG2[u0, thE] wsBuild[G, 2, u0, thE]; X3op = wsPre3red[u0, thE] wsBuild[G, 3, u0, thE];\n  l1 = wsLamK[1, thE[[2]], thE]; l2 = wsLamK[2, u0, thE]; l3 = wsLamK[3, u0, thE];\n  a = (phi[[1]] - c)/(phi[[1]] - phi[[4]]); kap = 1 - c eps; y = (zz[[2]] + zz[[3]])/2; s = 1 - kap (zz[[1]] + zz[[4]]); Nk = (1 - kap zz[[1]])^2;\n  lam = Table[1/Product[If[m == j, 1, zz[[j]] - zz[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}];\n  bra0 = Flatten@KroneckerProduct[lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}];\n  braW = Flatten@KroneckerProduct[{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}];\n  kap0 = -((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[4]] - zz[[2]]) (zz[[4]] - zz[[3]]));\n  nrm = lam[[1]]^2 ((zz[[4]] - zz[[2]]) (zz[[4]] - zz[[3]]))^2; nu = thE[[2]] - thE[[4]]; ut = {1, -(zz[[2]] + zz[[3]]), zz[[2]] zz[[3]]};\n  blk = wsSectBlocks[{{0, 0, 0, 0}}][[1]];\n  {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[Normal[comb[[blk, blk]]], 90]];\n  Table[Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0, 256], p, X1, X2, X3, r4, K, rho2, rho4, P, w, wQ, cd, cq},\n    psi[[blk]] = v/Norm[v]; p = Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]];\n    X1 = (T2 . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; r4 = (T4 . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; X2 = (X2op . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; X3 = (X3op . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]];\n    K = s^2 + kap s (X1/(h^2 l1) + X2/(2 h^4 y l2) + X3/(6 h^5 y^2 l3)) + kap^2 X3 X1/(24 h^7 y^2 l1 l3);\n    rho2 = X1/(h (thE[[1]] - thE[[2]]) (thE[[2]] - thE[[3]]) (nu - h)); rho4 = r4/(h (thE[[1]] - thE[[4]]) nu (thE[[3]] - thE[[4]]));\n    P = wsPab[nu, h][rho2, rho4];\n    w = braW . psi; wQ = (bra0 . psi) (a/kap0)^2 (ut . P . ut)/nrm;\n    {K w/Nk, K wQ/Nk, Abs[w - wQ]/Max[Abs[w], 10^-60], K}], {v, vecs}]];\nwsEpsList = {1/100, 1/200, 1/400, 1/800};\nwsEpsRes = Table[wsEpsRun[e, {9/10, 7/20, 3/5, -11/10}, {0, 37/100}, 3/10], {e, wsEpsList}];\nwsEpsSing = Table[Select[wsEpsRes[[j]], Abs[#[[1]]] > 0.05 &], {j, Length[wsEpsList]}];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{wsEpsList[[j]], Length[wsEpsSing[[j]]], N[Abs[#[[1]]] & /@ wsEpsSing[[j]], 8], N[Abs[#[[2]]] & /@ wsEpsSing[[j]], 8], N[#[[3]] & /@ wsEpsSing[[j]], 3]}, {j, Length[wsEpsList]}], {\"eps\", \"# states with |C_direct| > 0.05\", \"|C_direct| = |K w/N|\", \"|C_Q| = |K w_Q/N|\", \"|w - w_Q|/|w|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"86\" data-out-n=\"499\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"43\" data-sub-start=\"28\" data-sub-end=\"28\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[499]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.08em;vertical-align:-2.77em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.31em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.27em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.27em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.04em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.77em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.27em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.43em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eps</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.22em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span cl