  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result [hp, exact operators].** At every ε ∈ {1/100,1/200,1/400,1/800} and for all 28 states of the weight-(0,0,0,0) sector |w − w_Q|/|w| < 1e-66, i.e. the closed form reproduces ⟨W_a|Ψ_ε⟩ exactly at the pair-by-pair ABJM θ with φ₂ ≠ φ₃. The two singlets (|C(ε)| = 0.1579566, 0.1580350, 0.1580744, 0.1580941 and 0.2039019, 0.2040176, 0.2040720, 0.2040983) extrapolate (cubic fit in ε) to 0.15811388301 (target 1/√40 = 0.15811388301, diff 2e-12) and 0.20412414524 (1/√24 = 0.20412414523, diff 9e-12). The twisted-vacuum parameter: w₁ = (a z₄ − κ₀ z₁)/(a − κ₀), check below.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsEpsVac[eps_, phi_, thdir_, c_] := Module[{zz = 1 + eps phi, thF = eps thdir, thE, G, comb, a, kap0, w1, ww, vd, ud, braV, braW, blk, vals, vecs, h = wsH},\n  thE = {thF[[1]] + 2 h, thF[[1]], thF[[2]] + 2 h, thF[[2]]}; G = DiagonalMatrix[zz];\n  comb = wsBuild[G, 1, 3/11, thE] + 7/10 wsPre[3, -5/7, thE] wsBuild[G, 3, -5/7, thE] - 3/13 wsPre[2, 2/9, thE] wsBuild[G, 2, 2/9, thE];\n  a = (phi[[1]] - c)/(phi[[1]] - phi[[4]]); kap0 = wsMob[zz, Infinity /. Infinity -> 10^40] ;\n  kap0 = -((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[4]] - zz[[2]]) (zz[[4]] - zz[[3]]));\n  w1 = (a zz[[4]] - kap0 zz[[1]])/(a - kap0); ww = {w1, zz[[2]], zz[[3]], 1 + eps/2};\n  vd = wsVdD[zz, ww]; ud = wsUdD[zz, ww];\n  braV = Flatten@KroneckerProduct[vd, ud, vd, ud]/(vd[[1]] ud[[4]])^2;\n  braW = Flatten@KroneckerProduct[{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}];\n  blk = wsSectBlocks[{{0, 0, 0, 0}}][[1]]; {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[Normal[comb[[blk, blk]]], 90]];\n  {a, wsMob[zz, w1] == a, (w1 - 1)/eps, Max[Table[Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0, 256]}, psi[[blk]] = v/Norm[v]; Abs[braV . psi - braW . psi]/Max[Abs[braW . psi], 10^-60]], {v, vecs}]]}];\nwsEpsVacRes = Table[wsEpsVac[e, {9/10, 7/20, 3/5, -11/10}, {0, 37/100}, 3/10], {e, {1/100, 1/400}}];\nGrid[Prepend[wsEpsVacRes, {\"a\", \"a(w1) == a\", \"omega1 = (w1-1)/eps\", \"max_28 |(v1u4)^-2 <0_w|Psi> - <W_a|Psi>|/|<W_a|Psi>|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
