  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.8 The w₁-polynomial of the Q-sum in closed form (check on the 54 states)\n\n𝕎_w(Ψ) = [λ₁(z₄−z₂)(z₄−z₃)(w₁−z₂)(w₁−z₃)(w₁−z₄)²]² a(w₁)ⁿ Γ_Ψ, Γ_Ψ = ⟨W₁|Ψ⟩/⟨0|Ψ⟩ (w₄-independent).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsPolyW1[w1_, w4_] := Module[{ww = {w1, wsZ[[2]], wsZ[[3]], w4}, tY, Wvec, pref, aa, lam1 = wsLam1, errs, scale},\n  tY = wsTauYQ[ww]; Wvec = N[tY, 60] . wsMn60;\n  aa = wsMob[wsZ, w1];\n  pref = (lam1 (wsZ[[4]] - wsZ[[2]]) (wsZ[[4]] - wsZ[[3]]) (w1 - wsZ[[2]]) (w1 - wsZ[[3]]) (w1 - wsZ[[4]])^2)^2;\n  errs = Table[Abs[Wvec . wsTauX[[All, k]] - pref aa^wsSect[[k]] wsDirN[[wsSect[[k]] + 1, k]]/wsOv0[[k]]], {k, wsActive54}];\n  scale = Max[Table[Abs[Wvec . wsTauX[[All, k]]], {k, wsActive54}]];\n  {N[Max[errs]/scale, 3], N[scale, 4]}];\nwsPolyRes = {wsPolyW1[7/5, 5/9], wsPolyW1[11/3, 2/7], wsPolyW1[-5/4, 13/9]};\nGrid[Prepend[Table[Prepend[wsPolyRes[[j]], {7/5, 11/3, -5/4}[[j]]], {j, 3}], {\"w1\", \"max_54 |W_w - [lam1 (z4-z2)(z4-z3)(w1-z2)(w1-z3)(w1-z4)^2]^2 a(w1)^n <W_1|Psi>/<0|Psi>| / max|W_w|\", \"max|W_w|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
